    "problemStatement": "Given an N \u00d7 M grid where 0 represents blocked cells and 1 represents open cells, generate all possible paths from the top-left cell to the bottom-right cell. The traveler may move Up, Down, Left, and Right, but cannot visit the same cell more than once in a path. Print all valid paths in lexicographical order.",
